c hỗ trợ chuẩn nén H.265\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e+ Camera Tích hợp cảm biến PIR\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Hỗ trợ tầm nhìn ban đêm có màu thông minh\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Hỗ trợ lưu trữ: Hỗ trợ khe cắm thẻ nhớ tối đa đến 256GB\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Nguồn điện: DC 5V\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Chuẩn chống bụi nước IP65\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBạn có thể đặt Camera B32P Bất Cứ Đâu, Mang Theo Bất Cứ Nơi Nào Bạn Muốn, Chạm Để Ghi Vog, Chỉnh Sửa Nó Bằng Một Cú Nhấp Chuột Và Chia Sẻ Nó Một Cách Nhanh Chóng.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/71/64/f0/7162ecb63f95a2e6d9e152f1c56172ca.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"351\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/41/be/b9/fce2aa1b93133473dd02cf7fdc36529e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"426\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/2f/c1/55/5fd6c381d102c1af67fa44559bde873e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"401\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e6/4b/bf/1f6d6112bd74663380bd4a72cbbb34cf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"397\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/9d/6b/2f/a3ecdd57a9d08526e6576ff853e2300a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"440\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/de/e1/13/bb7856a0cf1c84d64580399ed8e8b235.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"393\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;ma